WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:04.710
2020 has been a terrifying year - to say the
least - but that doesn't mean horror fans

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:07.529
aren't clamoring for some more enjoyable scares
in the near future.

00:00:07.529 --> 00:00:09.190
Well, they're in luck.

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:13.419
From high-impact sequels to chilling originals,
these are the creepiest movies due for release

00:00:13.419 --> 00:00:15.000
in 2021.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.080
Directed by Nia DaCosta and co-written by
horror legend Jordan Peele, Candyman is a

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:23.430
sequel to the original 1992 horror classic
- one that picks up in real time, decades

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:25.580
after the events of the first movie.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:29.330
The film follows multimedia artist Anthony
McCoy, whose obsession with the now fully

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:34.269
gentrified site of the infamous Candyman murders
begins to take on an entire life of its own.

00:00:34.269 --> 00:00:37.760
The new Candyman trailer offers up a whole
lot of hints about what might go down in the

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:41.940
movie, including a number of callbacks to
the original, such as the presence of an overwhelming

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:44.989
number of bees and the iconic imagery of Candyman
himself.

00:00:44.989 --> 00:00:48.780
However, the movie looks like it's diverging
from the original by suggesting that Anthony

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:52.499
might actually be getting possessed by the
spirit of Candyman, as opposed to simply being

00:00:52.499 --> 00:00:55.789
haunted by him, taking things to an entirely
new level of scary.

00:00:55.789 --> 00:01:00.170
And yeah, Tony Todd, who played the original
bee-loving slasher, is returning to the franchise,

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:01.170
too.

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:03.960
Candyman is set for release in August 2021.

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:08.719
The Office alum John Krasinski made a surprising
pivot from comedy to horror with 2018's A

00:01:08.719 --> 00:01:12.591
Quiet Place, a surprising box office smash
that was both written and directed by the

00:01:12.591 --> 00:01:14.280
comedian-turned-filmmaker.

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:18.409
Set in an apocalyptic world overrun by human-eating
monsters who respond to sound, the Abbott

00:01:18.409 --> 00:01:20.680
family has finally figured out how to make
their life work.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:25.460
That is, until a series of tragedies unfold,
including the loss of a loved one and a chilling

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:29.210
ending in which a postpartum Evelyn and her
surviving family members must face off with

00:01:29.210 --> 00:01:31.600
a steadily-growing horde of monsters.

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:35.340
While details about A Quiet Place Part II
are sparse, the teasers hint that the remaining

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:38.950
Abbotts will have to leave their farmhouse
sanctuary and venture out into a hostile world

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:43.090
- one filled not only flesh-eating monsters,
but also other survivors.

00:01:43.090 --> 00:01:47.340
A Quiet Place Part II will feature the same
original cast, including John Krasinski in

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:51.180
flashbacks, as well as adding Cillian Murphy
and Djimon Hounsou to the ensemble.

00:01:51.180 --> 00:01:56.390
The tentative release date is set for April
2021.

00:01:56.390 --> 00:01:58.422
"Let the game begin."

00:01:58.422 --> 00:02:01.760
The Saw franchise has seen its fair share
of ups and downs over the years.

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:05.409
Sure, each of the eight installments has more
than provided on the gore front, but as for

00:02:05.409 --> 00:02:08.130
quality - well, that's been a little inconsistent.

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:13.230
Fortunately, 2017's Jigsaw put some new twists
and turns into what had become a rather stale

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:14.230
plot.

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:18.422
Presumably following in Jigsaw's vein, May
2021 will see the release of Spiral: From

00:02:18.422 --> 00:02:23.170
the Book of Saw, starring Chris Rock as Detective
Zeke Banks, whose current investigation will

00:02:23.170 --> 00:02:26.140
lead all the way back to the first movie in
the Saw saga.

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:29.370
But Chris Rock isn't just starring in his
first ever horror movie - he's actually a

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:33.390
long-time Saw fan and the one who came up
with Spiral's concept, and wrote the story's

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:34.390
treatment.

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:38.129
Longtime Saw collaborators are all on board
the Jigsaw train for Spiral as well, with

00:02:38.129 --> 00:02:43.459
Darren Lynn Bousman directing and both James
Wan and Leigh Whannell signed on as producers.

00:02:43.459 --> 00:02:47.299
The newest installment of the Conjuring franchise,
The Devil Made Me Do It, will be the eighth

00:02:47.299 --> 00:02:50.690
film set in that universe - although it's
actually a direct sequel to the first two

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:52.360
Conjuring movies.

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:56.320
Featuring Vera Farmiga and Patrick Wilson
as paranormal investigators Ed and Lorraine

00:02:56.320 --> 00:03:01.209
Warren, The Devil Made Me Do It follows the
infamous real-life 1981 Arne Cheyenne Johnson

00:03:01.209 --> 00:03:05.150
murder trial, which was the first time in
American legal history that demonic possession

00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:07.819
was used as a "not guilty" defense.

00:03:07.819 --> 00:03:12.160
Johnson's defense was laughed out of court,
but he served only five years of his 20-year sentence.

00:03:12.430 --> 00:03:16.610
It's likely that the third proper Conjuring
movie will be suitably dramatic - with plenty

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:20.050
of nail-biting court scenes to break up all
those jump scares.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:23.939
The Devil Made Me Do It is directed by The
Curse of La Llorona's Michael Chaves, and

00:03:23.939 --> 00:03:27.090
Conjuring franchise "founder" James Wan has
signed on as producer.

00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:31.970
The Devil Made Me Do It should hit cinemas
and video-on-demand services in June 2021.

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:37.040
Having first been introduced to the world
of Marvel comics all the way back in 1971,

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:40.310
Morbius the Living Vampire is finally getting
his own movie.

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:44.600
2021's Morbius tells the story of Michael
Morbius, a human turned bloodsucker thanks

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:47.150
to the side effects of a cure for his rare
blood disease.

00:03:47.150 --> 00:03:50.950
But while Morbius might be a vamp, he has
none of the qualities you've come to expect

00:03:50.950 --> 00:03:55.810
from the supernatural species - other than
super strength and an extreme lust for blood.

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:59.900
Also starring Doctor Who alum Matt Smith,
as well as Jared Harris, Morbius will be part

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:01.599
of Sony's ever-expanding Spiderverse.

00:04:01.599 --> 00:04:05.890
From the trailer, Morbius looks suitably brooding,
gothic, and action-packed.

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:09.870
It's also set to bring some disturbingly brilliant
creature effects to the table, as well as

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:14.599
a cameo or two - specifically, Michael Keaton
is reprising his role as Adrian Toomes from

00:04:14.599 --> 00:04:16.239
Spider-Man: Homecoming.

00:04:16.239 --> 00:04:20.370
This superhero horror crossover should be
hitting theaters in March 2021.

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:25.500
Fede Alvarez's chilling 2016 horror feature,
Don't Breathe, has had a sequel in the works

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:27.460
ever since it first came out.

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:31.280
The first Don't Breathe followed Norman Nordstrom,
a blind veteran who's rumored to live with

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:33.720
loads of cash stashed around his house.

00:04:33.720 --> 00:04:37.180
After three robbers break in and try to steal
from him, Nordstrom reveals himself to be

00:04:37.180 --> 00:04:41.580
far more capable than his reclusive reputation
might suggest, brutalizing the robbers one

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:43.910
by one as they attempt to escape his home.

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:48.050
Eventually, Rocky, one of the robbers, manages
to escape, and Don't Breathe ends with Nordstrom

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:50.000
surviving to plan his revenge.

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:52.620
But things seem to have taken a turn in Don't
Breathe 2.

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:56.300
Apparently, Nordstrom has moved to a remote
cabin in the woods, where he now cares for

00:04:56.300 --> 00:04:59.800
an orphan girl - a kind of replacement for
the daughter he lost before the events of

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:00.930
the original movie.

00:05:00.930 --> 00:05:05.776
Eventually, people from her past track her
down, not realizing who her new adopted father is.

00:05:05.776 --> 00:05:09.020
The big question, of course, is whether Rocky
will appear in this sequel.

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:11.500
But there's no news on those plot details
yet.

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:14.930
What you certainly can expect, though, is
that Nordstrom will pull out all his incredible

00:05:14.930 --> 00:05:18.860
tactical skills to protect his surrogate daughter,
just like he did in the original.

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:22.389
Don't Breathe 2 is set for an August 2021
release.

00:05:22.389 --> 00:05:26.780
In what will be the fifth and final installment
of James DeMonaco's Purge franchise, The Forever

00:05:26.780 --> 00:05:31.009
Purge is one of the upcoming 2021 releases
that we know the least about.

00:05:31.009 --> 00:05:35.090
No teaser trailer has been released, and plot
details have been scarce, other than DeMonaco

00:05:35.090 --> 00:05:38.580
telling Entertainment Weekly that he had come
up with a "really cool" way to round out the

00:05:38.580 --> 00:05:42.080
last of his ultraviolent, socially-aware horror
series.

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:46.410
Set in an America that allows a 12-hour window
once a year where all crimes are legal, each

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:50.360
installment of The Purge franchise has deepened
its cultural critique regarding the roots

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:53.680
of violence, state-sanctioned crime, and social
control through fear.

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:57.639
While some installments of the franchise have
hinted at changes in legislation to end the

00:05:57.639 --> 00:06:01.319
Purge in this fictional America, the title
of the final film suggests that an end to

00:06:01.319 --> 00:06:04.210
this horrific event might not actually be
on the horizon.

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:08.699
The Forever Purge is slated for a July 2021
theatrical release, followed quickly by a

00:06:08.699 --> 00:06:11.350
video-on-demand release.

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:16.610
Adam Robitel's 2019 movie Escape Room capitalized
on the new entertainment trend of, you guessed

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:17.870
it, escape rooms.

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:21.569
Also known as puzzle rooms, these are those
stylized locked rooms in which participants

00:06:21.569 --> 00:06:23.509
must solve clues to find their way out.

00:06:23.509 --> 00:06:27.690
However, in the movie itself, the titular
room turns out to not be a game at all, but

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:31.620
rather a twisted experiment to see who's the
fittest in a group of already-traumatized

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:32.620
survivors.

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:36.180
The whole affair is orchestrated by an enigmatic
figure named the Puzzlemaker, and by the end

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:40.190
of the film, the two survivors begin spying
on the escape room organizers, waiting for

00:06:40.190 --> 00:06:42.139
their moment of revenge.

00:06:42.139 --> 00:06:46.190
Escape Room 2 stars both survivors as leads
once again, suggesting the sequel will pick

00:06:46.190 --> 00:06:48.210
up where the first left off.

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:52.199
Orphan actress Isabelle Fuhrman will also
join the Escape Room 2 cast, along with Pose

00:06:52.199 --> 00:06:53.498
star Indya Moore.

00:06:53.498 --> 00:06:57.020
There's no release date announced yet, other
than that it will be released in the later

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:58.245
half of 2021.

00:06:58.245 --> 00:07:02.401
Expect scores of fiendishly clever traps,
a bunch of cleverly designed rooms, and some

00:07:02.401 --> 00:07:04.899
very disturbing kills.

00:07:04.899 --> 00:07:09.190
While Oren Peli's Paranormal Activity series
has been one of the most lucrative horror

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:13.330
franchises of all time, raking in piles of
cash thanks to its low-budget filmmaking,

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:17.240
the critical reception towards the films themselves
has been fairly inconsistent.

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:21.129
With Peli's bump to producer after the first
film and Christopher Landon taking over writing

00:07:21.129 --> 00:07:24.979
- and eventually directing — most of the
subsequent movies, Paranormal Activity has

00:07:24.979 --> 00:07:28.760
followed the Featherstone family's demonic
curse as it reaches out into the lives of

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:30.166
the people who have met them.

00:07:30.166 --> 00:07:34.660
Details about the seventh installment - including
its subtitle, cast, and plot - remain a mystery

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:38.640
at the moment, but the film is still planned
for a 2021 release.

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:42.590
But what we do know is that Landon will be
returning to the project in some capacity,

00:07:42.590 --> 00:07:46.340
although he's confirmed he won't be involved
in the script or production, as he had been

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:48.680
in previous installments.

00:07:48.680 --> 00:07:52.860
Run Sweetheart Run is based on a terrifying
real-life encounter that began with a sexual

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:57.199
assault and ended with director Shana Feste
barefoot in the Hollywood Hills, with no phone

00:07:57.199 --> 00:08:00.000
or wallet, and forced to walk to her home
in West Hollywood.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:04.440
Ella Balinska stars as the titular "sweetheart,"
across from Game of Thrones star actor Pilou

00:08:04.440 --> 00:08:08.090
Asbek as her date-turned-stalker in the urban
landscape of Los Angeles.

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:12.389
"I think every woman could relate to something
like that, because every woman has their own

00:08:12.389 --> 00:08:14.528
real-life horror film to tell."

00:08:14.528 --> 00:08:18.970
Inspired by the social justice style of horror
put to use in Jordan Peele's Get Out, Feste

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:22.580
wanted to draw attention to the daily misogyny
that women deal with - and take it to its

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:24.390
most devastating extreme.

00:08:24.390 --> 00:08:28.370
In that sense, Run Sweetheart Run is the true
story of most women's ultimate nightmare,

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:31.789
and although it's not going to be an easy
watch, it might just be the sleeper horror

00:08:31.789 --> 00:08:32.789
hit of the year.

00:08:32.789 --> 00:08:37.410
Run Sweetheart Run also features Sense8's
Aml Ameen and Marvel's own Clark Gregg.

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:41.700
The film premiered at Sundance to an excellent
critical reception in 2019, and will be hitting

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:44.678
Amazon Prime in early 2021.

00:08:44.909 --> 00:08:50.350
After the surprising success of the 2018 sequel
to the '70s classic slasher Halloween, horror

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:54.200
fans were thrilled at the news there was a
full Halloween sequel trilogy in the works,

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:58.030
one which will explore the long-term trauma
suffered by Laurie Strode and her family at

00:08:58.030 --> 00:09:00.900
the hands of serial killer-stalker Michael
Myers.

00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:05.210
Picking up exactly where the 2018 Halloween
left off, Halloween Kills finds the Strode

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:09.090
women newly traumatized by a deeply disturbing
encounter with the Shape; one that results

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:12.145
in more than double the original body count
of Halloween.

00:09:12.145 --> 00:09:16.310
Featuring Judy Greer as Laurie's daughter
Karen and Andi Matichak as her granddaughter

00:09:16.310 --> 00:09:20.510
Allyson, Halloween Kills will also focus a
good chunk of its story on the many denizens

00:09:20.510 --> 00:09:24.400
of Haddonfield who've also been living in
the shadow of Myers' rampages.

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:28.440
These include Laurie's original babysitting
charges Tommy Doyle, now a grown man played

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:32.590
by Anthony Michael Hall, and his friend, Lindsey
Wallace, played by the original movie's Kyle

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:33.590
Richards.

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:37.810
So, where 2018's Halloween explored the trauma
of the Strode women, Halloween Kills looks

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:42.970
to examine the collective trauma of the town
- as Myers embarks on yet another rampage.

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:46.960
Originally slated for an October 14th 2020
release, the new premiere is scheduled for

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:48.840
October 15th, 2021.

00:09:48.840 --> 00:09:53.080
A follow-up, Halloween Ends, is due for release
in October 2022.

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:55.040
"Goodbye, Michael."

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:57.340
Check out one of our newest videos right here!

00:09:57.340 --> 00:10:01.160
Plus, even more Looper videos about your favorite
movies are coming soon.

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:04.770
Subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit the
bell so you don't miss a single one.

